11:## How to use this folder
12:
13:This folder is the source-of-truth workspace for one change. Complete artifacts in order, link decisions to evidence, and do not mark the change complete when a required check is blocked, not-run or unresolved.
14:
15:The selected tier is HighRisk. Every change starts with a problem map; Normal adds discovery, architecture, backend and contract artifacts; HighRisk adds a security delta. Add the AI artifact when IncludeAI is selected.
