28:
29:## Summary
30:
31:The registration fee badge in the organizer `Đăng ký & Vận động viên` table becomes a
32:checkbox the organizer controls directly:
33:
34:- **Tick** — records a fee collected outside the system. No money moves.
35:- **Untick, no system payment** — undoes a manual mark. No refund, nothing financial.
36:- **Untick, system payment** — raises one refund request. The organizer still has to
37:  send the money back; an admin settles it through the existing route, unchanged.
38:
39:Untick always asks first, and the warning is stronger when money is actually behind the
40:tick. No schema change, no new enum, and the endpoint can never execute a refund.
